-- National Insurance Law [Consolidated Version], s 337 (שיעור דמי ביטוח) — the rate of insurance
-- contributions. Quotations (`src:N`) are copied mechanically from line N of
-- ../../registers/source-bundle/national-insurance-law-consolidated-version-5755-1995.he.wiki.txt.
--
-- WHAT THIS SECTION DOES. (a) says the contributions s 335 imposes are Schedule J's percentages of
-- the insured person's income: monthly for an employee, annual (divided into the advance periods)
-- for anyone else. (b) lets the Minister change the Schedule J rates by order, with conditions.
-- (c) carries such a change through, proportionally, to the employee's wage deduction (s 342(c)).
--
-- NOT IN THIS MODULE: which branches a person pays (s 335), what counts as income and its maximum
-- and minimum (ss 344-351, s 348 and Schedule K, row IL-05), the deduction itself (s 342, row
-- IL-05), and the work-injury and maternity special rates (s 340). Each enters as an input.

§ `Section 337 — rate of insurance contributions`
-- src:3625 | סעיף 337 – שיעור דמי ביטוח [תיקון: תשנ״ח־7, תש״ס־2, תשס״ב־6, תשס״ב־7, תשס״ג־8, תשס״ג־12, תשע״ח־5]

§§ `Where another section displaces the rates of section 337`

-- s 341 (reduced rates by order, "notwithstanding sections 337 and 340") and s 343 (reduced
-- work-injury contributions for an approved employer of at least 500 employees) are not in this
-- row; nor is the order made under s 341. A case they reach is declined, by name, rather than
-- answered at the Schedule J rates they displace (phrasebook 2.2 and 11.5). Whether they reach a
-- case is an input (nii-il04-nouns.l4).
-- src:3654 | סעיף 341 – שיעורים מופחתים [תיקון: תשנ״ח־7, תשס״ה־6, תשפ״ה־7]
-- src:3655 | על אף הוראות סעיפים 337 ו־340 רשאי השר, באישור ועדת הכספים של הכנסת, לקבוע בצו שיעורים מופחתים של דמי ביטוח לגבי חלק מהכנסתו של מבוטח שהוא עובד עצמאי או שהוא עובד או של מבוטח שאינו עובד ואינו עובד עצמאי, או להחיל שיעורים מופחתים על הכנסה של מבוטח כאמור שלא תעלה על סכום שיקבע בצו; הוראות לפי סעיף זה, שהיו בתוקף לפני יום א׳ בטבת התשס״ו (1 בינואר 2006) לענין קביעת סכום השכר או ההכנסה שאינם עולים על מחצית השכר הממוצע, יחולו לענין קביעת סכום השכר או ההכנסה שאינם עולים על מדרגת הגבייה המופחתת.
-- src:3656 | [note: פורסם צו הביטוח הלאומי (שיעורים מופחתים של דמי ביטוח), התשנ״ט–1999.]
-- src:3677 | סעיף 343 – דמי ביטוח מופחתים
-- src:3678 | השר רשאי לקבוע כי מעביד שאישר לכך ישלם דמי ביטוח מופחתים לענין סעיף 340 כפי שיקבע, ובלבד שנתמלאו בו תנאים אלה:
@ref National Insurance Law s 341 (source lines 3654-3656), not in this row
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`reduced rates under an order made under section 341 apply to this income, and the order is not encoded here` MEANS
    REFUSE "reduced rates under an order made under section 341 apply to this income, and the order is not encoded here"

@ref National Insurance Law s 343 (source lines 3677-3680), not in this row
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the employer pays reduced work-injury contributions under section 343, which is not encoded here` MEANS
    REFUSE "the employer pays reduced work-injury contributions under section 343, which is not encoded here"

§§ `337(a)(1) — an employee: monthly, of the monthly income`

-- src:3626 | (א)(1) שיעורי דמי הביטוח החודשיים לפי סעיף 335 לענין עובד הם אחוזים כאמור בלוח י׳, מהכנסתו החודשית.
-- Three entry points. The first takes the reduced collection threshold as an argument, so that a
-- caller who holds the figure for 2027 or later (nii-s334-interpretation.l4 declines those) can
-- still compute, and takes as a second argument whether an order under Amendment 252 s 7(b)
-- extended the temporary provision to the year (Repair 2026-10-07; an argument rather than a
-- field of the case record, so that records built before the repair still build). The second
-- assumes no such order (assumption A8). The third also looks the threshold up by year.
@ref National Insurance Law s 337(a)(1) (source line 3626); Schedule J (source lines 4709-4749); Amendment 252 s 7(b)
GIVEN m               IS AN `An employee's month of contributions`
      `the threshold` IS A NUMBER
      `an order`      IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 337(a)(1) — the monthly contributions for` m `with the threshold at` `the threshold` `, the temporary provision extended to that year by an order under Amendment 252 s 7(b):` `an order` MEANS
    BRANCH IF m's `reduced rates under an order made under section 341 apply to this income`
           THEN `reduced rates under an order made under section 341 apply to this income, and the order is not encoded here`
           IF       m's `the employer pays reduced work-injury contributions under section 343`
                AND `work injury` `is among` (m's `branches for which contributions are payable under section 335`)
           THEN `the employer pays reduced work-injury contributions under section 343, which is not encoded here`
           OTHERWISE
               `the contributions under` (`Schedule J — the version for a contribution month in` (m's `calendar year of the month`) `, the temporary provision extended to that year by an order under Amendment 252 s 7(b):` `an order`)
                   `for` `an employee`
                   `on` (m's `monthly income on which contributions are computed`)
                   `with the threshold at` `the threshold`
                   `in the branches` (m's `branches for which contributions are payable under section 335`)

@ref National Insurance Law s 337(a)(1) (source line 3626); assumption A8 (no order under Amendment 252 s 7(b))
GIVEN m               IS AN `An employee's month of contributions`
      `the threshold` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 337(a)(1) — the monthly contributions for` m `with the threshold at` `the threshold` MEANS
    `s 337(a)(1) — the monthly contributions for` m `with the threshold at` `the threshold` `, the temporary provision extended to that year by an order under Amendment 252 s 7(b):` FALSE

@ref National Insurance Law s 337(a)(1) (source line 3626); s 334(a) (source line 3605)
GIVEN m IS AN `An employee's month of contributions`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 337(a)(1) — the monthly contributions for` m MEANS
    `s 337(a)(1) — the monthly contributions for` m `with the threshold at`
        (`s 334(a) — the reduced collection threshold for a month in` (m's `calendar year of the month`))

§§ `337(a)(2) — another insured person: annual, of the annual income divided into the advance periods`

-- src:3627 | (2) שיעורי דמי הביטוח השנתיים לפי סעיף 335 לענין מבוטח אחר הם אחוזים כאמור בלוח י׳, מהכנסתו השנתית כשהיא מחולקת לתקופות שנקבעו לצורך תשלום מקדמות.
-- "of his annual income as divided into the periods set for the payment of advances": the
-- percentages apply to each period's share of the annual income, and the year's contributions are
-- the sum over the periods. Equal shares are taken (fork F8). The reduced collection threshold is
-- applied to a period's share; s 336 makes a payment period a month unless the Minister sets
-- otherwise, and the Institute applies the threshold to monthly income. For periods other than
-- months the Law does not say how the threshold scales, and this row declines (fork F8).
@ref National Insurance Law s 337(a)(2) (source line 3627), s 336 (source line 3623, not in this row)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 337(a)(2) is encoded only for advance-payment periods of a month, the period the reduced collection threshold is applied to` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 337(a)(2) is encoded only for advance-payment periods of a month, the period the reduced collection threshold is applied to"

GIVEN `the column` IS A `The Schedule J column of an insured person who is not an employee`
GIVETH A `A column of insured persons in Schedule J`
`the Schedule J column of` `the column` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the column`
    WHEN `the self-employed column` THEN `a self-employed person`
    WHEN `the column for an insured person who is neither an employee nor self-employed`
        THEN `an insured person who is neither an employee nor self-employed`

@ref National Insurance Law s 337(a)(2) (source line 3627); Schedule J (source lines 4709-4749); Amendment 252 s 7(b)
GIVEN y               IS AN `Another insured person's year of contributions`
      `the threshold` IS A NUMBER
      `an order`      IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 337(a)(2) — the contributions for each advance period, for` y `with the threshold at` `the threshold` `, the temporary provision extended to that year by an order under Amendment 252 s 7(b):` `an order` MEANS
    BRANCH IF y's `reduced rates under an order made under section 341 apply to this income`
           THEN `reduced rates under an order made under section 341 apply to this income, and the order is not encoded here`
           IF NOT (y's `number of periods set for paying advances` EQUALS 12)
           THEN `section 337(a)(2) is encoded only for advance-payment periods of a month, the period the reduced collection threshold is applied to`
           OTHERWISE
               `the contributions under` (`Schedule J — the version for a contribution month in` (y's `calendar year`) `, the temporary provision extended to that year by an order under Amendment 252 s 7(b):` `an order`)
                   `for` (`the Schedule J column of` (y's `column`))
                   `on` (y's `annual income on which contributions are computed` DIVIDED BY y's `number of periods set for paying advances`)
                   `with the threshold at` `the threshold`
                   `in the branches` (y's `branches for which contributions are payable under section 335`)

@ref National Insurance Law s 337(a)(2) (source line 3627); assumption A8 (no order under Amendment 252 s 7(b))
GIVEN y               IS AN `Another insured person's year of contributions`
      `the threshold` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 337(a)(2) — the contributions for each advance period, for` y `with the threshold at` `the threshold` MEANS
    `s 337(a)(2) — the contributions for each advance period, for` y `with the threshold at` `the threshold` `, the temporary provision extended to that year by an order under Amendment 252 s 7(b):` FALSE

@ref National Insurance Law s 337(a)(2) (source line 3627); s 334(a) (source line 3605)
GIVEN y IS AN `Another insured person's year of contributions`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 337(a)(2) — the contributions for each advance period, for` y MEANS
    `s 337(a)(2) — the contributions for each advance period, for` y `with the threshold at`
        (`s 334(a) — the reduced collection threshold for a month in` (y's `calendar year`))

@ref National Insurance Law s 337(a)(2) (source line 3627)
GIVEN y IS AN `Another insured person's year of contributions`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 337(a)(2) — the annual contributions for` y MEANS
    `s 337(a)(2) — the contributions for each advance period, for` y
        TIMES y's `number of periods set for paying advances`

§§ `337(b) — the Minister's power to change the rates by order`

-- src:3628 | (ב) השר, באישור ועדת הכספים של הכנסת, רשאי לשנות בצו את שיעורי דמי הביטוח האמורים בלוח י׳, ואולם שינוי שיעורי דמי הביטוח לענין זכויות עובדים בהליכי חדלות פירעון ייעשה לאחר התייעצות עם שר האוצר, ולענין ביטוח סיעוד – בהסכמת שר האוצר.
-- A power, and the conditions on its exercise. Encoded as the test whether an order is within
-- it: made by the Minister, approved by the Finance Committee, and, "but" (ואולם), for the
-- insolvency branch after consulting the Minister of Finance and for long-term care with his
-- consent. The two provisos bite only when the order changes that branch's rates (drafting
-- pattern: the proviso limb, (NOT X) OR Y). An order made under (b) amends Schedule J; the
-- deposited text is the schedule as amended at retrieval, so no order is applied on top of it.
@ref National Insurance Law s 337(b) (source line 3628)
GIVEN o IS AN `An order changing the rates in Schedule J`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 337(b) — the order is within the Minister's power` o MEANS
        o's `made by the Minister`
    AND o's `approved by the Finance Committee of the Knesset`
    AND (   NOT (`employees' rights in insolvency proceedings` `is among` (o's `branches whose rates it changes`))
         OR o's `made after consultation with the Minister of Finance`)
    AND (   NOT (`long-term care` `is among` (o's `branches whose rates it changes`))
         OR o's `made with the consent of the Minister of Finance`)

GIVEN `the branch`   IS A `A branch of insurance`
      `the branches` IS A LIST OF `A branch of insurance`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the branch` `is among` `the branches` MEANS
    any (GIVEN b YIELD b EQUALS `the branch`) `the branches`

§§ `337(c) — the change carries through to the employee's deduction`

-- src:3629 | (ג) שונה שיעור דמי הביטוח מכוח סעיף קטן (ב), ישונה, באותה דרך ובאופן יחסי, שיעור דמי הביטוח שמעביד ינכה משכרו של עובד לפי סעיף 342(ג).
-- "If the rate of contributions is changed under (b), the rate the employer deducts from the
-- employee's wage under s 342(c) is changed in the same way and proportionally." Read as: the
-- deduction rate is multiplied by the ratio of the new rate to the old (fork F9). Which column C
-- rate is "the rate" for which column D figure (above / not above the threshold) is the caller's
-- choice of arguments; the natural pairing is the employee's column C figure on the same part.
-- A rate of 0 before the change has no proportion, and is declined.
@ref National Insurance Law s 337(c) (source line 3629)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 337(c) gives no proportion for a change from a rate of 0` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 337(c) gives no proportion for a change from a rate of 0"

@ref National Insurance Law s 337(c) (source line 3629); s 342(c) (row IL-05)
GIVEN `the deduction before` IS A NUMBER
      `the rate before`      IS A NUMBER
      `the rate after`       IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 337(c) — the deduction of` `the deduction before` `after the rate changes from` `the rate before` `to` `the rate after` MEANS
    IF   `the rate before` EQUALS 0
    THEN `section 337(c) gives no proportion for a change from a rate of 0`
    ELSE `the deduction before` TIMES (`the rate after` DIVIDED BY `the rate before`)
